# Never upload secrets, local databases or test output with `vercel deploy`.
# Settings come from the Vercel project's Environment Variables instead.
# Leading "/" = only at the project root (a bare "data/" would also drop src/components/data/).
/.env*
!/.env.example
/data/
/.e2e/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/node_modules/
/.next/
